---
import Matrix from "../components/Matrix.astro";
import { agents, results, sitePath, tests } from "../data";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const observed = results.filter(
  (r) => r.result.status === "pass" || r.result.status === "fail",
);
---
<Layout><section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Open conformance suite · v0.1</div><h1>Tested facts about<br /><span class="accent">AI coding agents.</span></h1><p>What does your coding agent actually support? Small, reproducible tests for Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, OpenCode and more.</p><p style="font-size:14px">No rankings. No synthetic scores.<br />Just documented and observed behavior.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={sitePath('/compare')}>Compare agents →</a><a class="button secondary" href={sitePath('/tests')}>Browse tests</a></div></div><div class="terminal"><div class="bar">● ● ● &nbsp; reproducible by design</div><div class="dim">$ harnessfacts run codex instructions.nested</div><br /><div>01 &nbsp; Create a temporary fixture</div><div>02 &nbsp; Run the agent</div><div>03 &nbsp; Check the exact output</div><div>04 &nbsp; Save the evidence</div><br /><div class="success">A fact you can inspect. A test you can repeat.</div><div class="dim">$ harnessfacts compare codex opencode</div></div></section><div class="stats"><div><strong>{agents.length}</strong><span>Agent adapters</span></div><div><strong>{tests.length}</strong><span>Executable tests</span></div><div><strong>{observed.length}</strong><span>Completed observations</span></div><div><strong>100%</strong><span>Open methodology</span></div></div><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><h2>The compatibility notebook</h2><p>Every observation has a version, an environment, and evidence.</p></div><Matrix ids={["claude-code","codex","gemini-cli","opencode"]} /></section><section class="cards"><a class="card" href={sitePath('/tests')}><span class="num">01 / REPRODUCE</span><h3>Small tests. Inspectable results.</h3><p>See the fixture, prompt, and exact condition behind every capability.</p>Browse the suite →</a><a class="card" href={sitePath('/methodology')}><span class="num">02 / UNDERSTAND</span><h3>Keep uncertainty visible.</h3><p>A documented feature is a claim. An observed result records one execution.</p>Read the methodology →</a><a class="card" href={sitePath('/contribute')}><span class="num">03 / CONTRIBUTE</span><h3>One result makes a difference.</h3><p>Run a test on your machine, add an adapter, or help verify another platform.</p>Contribute a result →</a></section></Layout>
